        "subject": "=⚠️ Appointment Booking Failed – Manual Action Required",
        "message": "=<p>Hi Team,</p>\n\n<p>\nThe system was unable to automatically create a callback appointment for the following lead.<br>\nPlease review the details in the sheet and manually schedule a callback in your calendar at your earliest convenience.\n</p>\n\n<p>Thank you for your attention to this.</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p><b>The lead details:</b></p>\n\n<p>\n<b>Name:</b> {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet1').item.json.Name }}<br>\n<b>Location:</b> {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet1').item.json.Location }}<br>\n<b>Experience:</b> {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet1').item.json.Experience }}<br>\n<b>Readiness':</b> {{ $json.Readiness }}<br>\n<b>Callback Time:</b> {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet1').item.json['Appointment time'] }}<br>\n<b>Phone:</b> {{ $('Get row(s) in sheet1').item.json['Caller Number '] }}\n</p>\n\nDetails:<br>\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1iM8Tj7VtgE5ZHFo2yQWmcbFsOEd6tJOHZrmctNZTwxw/edit?gid=209751908#gid=209751908\">\nClick here to open the sheet</a>\n<br><br>\n\n<p>\n<b>Next Step — Review the Conversation Log:</b><br>\nTo ensure proper follow-up, please review the candidate’s conversation transcript.<br>\nYou can access it by searching the caller’s phone number in the <i>End of Call Report</i> or by opening the link below:\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1iM8Tj7VtgE5ZHFo2yQWmcbFsOEd6tJOHZrmctNZTwxw/edit?gid=834852152#gid=834852152\">\nOpen Conversation Log</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>Thank you,<br>\nRecruiting Automation System</p>\n",
